msgid "Xorro Direct Wallet Payments for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce用のXorroダイレクトウォレット決済"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/x-o-r-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://github.com/x-o-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Accept cryptocurrency payments directly to your own wallets — no third-party"
" payment processor. Supports BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, "
"KAS, XTZ and 200+ coins/tokens with automatic on-chain verification."
msgstr ""
"サードパーティの決済プロセッサーではなく、独自のウォレットに直接暗号通貨の支払いを受け入れます。 "
"BTC、BCH、ETH、USDT、USDC、Dai、ton、ADA、APT、KAS、XTZ、200以上のコイン/トークンを自動オンチェーン検証でサポート."

#. Author of the plugin
